      "real": "Berger leads from pole on two stops against Fisichella's one-stopping Jordan. Fisichella leads between Berger's stops; Berger rejoins behind him after his second stop on lap 34 and passes him again at the second chicane on the same lap. Fisichella's left-rear tyre fails with six laps to go, and Berger wins by 17.5 s from Michael Schumacher."
